flowchart TD
    TRIGGER["a time-based need"] --> CLASSIFY{what kind of trigger?}
    CLASSIFY -->|deferrable periodic work| WM["WorkManager (Ch 30)"]
    CLASSIFY -->|server-driven event| FCM["FCM (Ch 49)"]
    CLASSIFY -->|approximate time-of-day| INEXACT["inexact alarm / WorkManager"]
    CLASSIFY -->|user-facing exact time| EXACT{permission?}
    EXACT -->|granted| SET["setAlarmClock / setExactAndAllowWhileIdle"]
    EXACT -->|denied| DEGRADE["degrade to inexact + explain"]
    SET --> PI["PendingIntent -> BroadcastReceiver"]
    INEXACT --> PI
    PI --> EFFECT["post notification (Ch 50) OR enqueue WorkManager"]
    STORE["alarm definitions persisted (SSOT, Ch 3)"] --> RESCHED["BOOT_COMPLETED / TIME_CHANGED -> reschedule"]
    RESCHED --> SET
